Here is the structured goal model for the multi-robot system delivering food and retrieving dishes in a hospital setting:

### Goal Model Table

| **Goal ID** | **Title** | **Text** | **Runtime Annot** | **Goal Type** | **Relation** |
|-------------|-----------|----------|-------------------|---------------|--------------|
| G1          | Main Mission | Deliver Food and Retrieve Dishes | - | Perform | - |
| G2          | Delivery of Food | Deliver food from the kitchen to the patient room | ; (sequential) | Perform | OR with G3 |
| G3          | Retrieval of Dirty Dishes | Retrieve dirty dishes from the patient room | ; (sequential) | Perform | OR with G2 |
| G2.1        | Prepare Food Order | Prepare the food order based on the request | - | Perform | AND with G2 |
| G2.2        | Navigate to Kitchen | Navigate to the kitchen | - | Perform | AND with G2 |
| G2.3        | Load Meal into Robot | Load the meal into the robot | - | Perform | AND with G2 |
| G2.4        | Navigate to Patient Room | Navigate to the patient's room | - | Perform | AND with G2 |
| G2.5        | Deliver Meal | Deliver the meal to the patient | ; (sequential) | Perform | AND with G2 |
| G2.6        | Confirm Delivery | Confirm successful delivery | - | Perform | AND with G2 |
| G3.1        | Determine Dish Retrieval Method | Choose the method for retrieving dishes | - | Perform | AND with G3 |
| G3.2        | Navigate to Patient Room | Navigate to the patient's room | - | Perform | AND with G3 |
| G3.3        | Retrieve Dishes | Retrieve the dirty dishes | ; (sequential) | Perform | AND with G3 |
| G3.4        | Confirm Dish Retrieval | Confirm successful retrieval | - | Perform | AND with G3 |

### Task Model Table

| **Task ID** | **Title** | **Text** | **Relation** | **Location** | **Number of Robots** |
|-------------|-----------|----------|--------------|--------------|----------------------|
| AT1         | Deliver Meal to Tray | Deliver meal to the tray | OR with G2.5 | Patient Room | 1 |
| AT2         | Assisted Delivery | Assist with delivery | OR with G2.5 | Patient Room | 1 or 2 |
| AT5         | Assisted Dish Retrieval | Retrieve dishes with assistance | OR with G3.3 | Patient Room | 1 or 2 |
| AT6         | Unassisted Dish Retrieval | Retrieve dishes alone | OR with G3.3 | Patient Room | 1 |

### Logical Relationships

- **G1 -> G2, G3** [OR][(sequential)]
- **G2 -> G2.1, G2.2, G2.3, G2.4, G2.5, G2.6** [AND][(sequential)]
- **G2.5 -> AT1, AT2** [OR]
- **G3 -> G3.1, G3.2, G3.3, G3.4** [AND][(sequential)]
- **G3.3 -> AT5, AT6** [OR]

This model ensures that the system can deliver food and retrieve dishes efficiently, considering various cooperation scenarios and execution sequences.

